<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right"><B>Exhibit 99.3</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>Psyence BioMed Signs LOI with Southern Star
Research to Expand Phase IIb Clinical Trial in Australia</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><I>&nbsp;</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><I>New partnership strengthens Psyence BioMed&rsquo;s
global clinical trial capabilities, accelerating the development of psilocybin-assisted therapy for adjustment disorder</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>NEW YORK, April 8, 2025</B> &mdash; Psyence
BioMed (Nasdaq: PBM) (&ldquo;Psyence BioMed&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) today announced the signing of a Letter of Intent (LOI)
with Southern Star Research Pty Ltd, a premier Australian contract research organization (CRO). This collaboration will accelerate Psyence
BioMed&rsquo;s ongoing Phase IIb psilocybin clinical trial in Australia, which focuses on adjustment disorder in patients diagnosed with
cancer.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Adjustment disorder ranks as the seventh most
frequently diagnosed psychiatric condition globally, affecting millions of people who currently have no FDA-approved pharmaceutical treatment.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The engagement of a new CRO represents a pivotal
step in optimizing Psyence BioMed&rsquo;s clinical trial, enabling collaboration with a broader national oncology and mental health network
to accelerate the Phase II clinical trial timeline. Southern Star Research&rsquo;s scale and capabilities will support the next phase
of the Company&rsquo;s clinical development plan. Psyence BioMed thanks iNGEN&umacr; CRO for their contribution to the protocol design, ethics
approval and site activation. To ensure continuity and operational efficiency, Psyence BioMed is coordinating a seamless handover of trial
management responsibilities to Southern Star Research as it moves forward with its clinical programs.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&ldquo;Southern Star Research&rsquo;s state-of-the-art
operations, with its advanced infrastructure, national network within Oncology and Mental health, as well as in-depth knowledge of the
Australian clinical trial environment will enhance patient recruitment and support efficient trial execution,&rdquo; said Dr. Neil Maresky,
CEO of Psyence BioMed. &ldquo;Their expertise and dedication to clinical excellence make them a strong partner in our mission to develop
innovative therapies that address the urgent mental health needs of patients with adjustment disorder.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Dr David Lloyd, Managing Director and Co-Founder
of Southern Star Research, expressed enthusiasm for the collaboration, stating: &ldquo;We are excited to collaborate with Psyence BioMed
on the expansion of their Phase IIb clinical trial. This partnership represents a significant step in our long-term commitment to advancing
novel psychedelic-assisted therapies for mental health conditions such as adjustment disorder, an area with an enormous unmet need. Our
talented team is dedicated to supporting the development of pioneering treatments, and we look forward to contributing to the success
of this important clinical trial and many more in the future.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 1 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Psyence BioMed senior leadership will discuss
the new agreement during the Company&rsquo;s corporate webinar on Thursday, April 10, 2025, at 12:00 PM EST.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">To register, please visit: https://psyencebiomed.com/corporate-webinar_april2025/</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Southern Star Research Pty Ltd</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Southern Star Research Pty Ltd is an Australian
full-service CRO specializing in providing clinical trial services for biotechnology and pharmaceutical companies. With a strong focus
on quality and partnership. Southern Star Research is dedicated to advancing clinical research and helping bring innovative therapies
to patients.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>About Psyence BioMed:</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Psyence Biomedical Ltd. (Nasdaq: PBM) is one
of the few multi-asset, vertically integrated biopharmaceutical companies specializing in psychedelic-based therapeutics. It is the
first life sciences biotechnology company focused on developing nature-derived (non-synthetic) psilocybin-based psychedelic medicine
to be listed on Nasdaq. Psyence is dedicated to addressing unmet mental health needs, particularly in palliative care. The name
&lsquo;Psyence&rsquo; merges &lsquo;psychedelics&rsquo; and &lsquo;science,&rsquo; reflecting the company&rsquo;s commitment to an
evidence-based approach in developing safe, effective, and FDA-approved nature-derived psychedelic treatments for a broad range of
mental health disorders.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Learn more at&nbsp;www.psyencebiomed.com&nbsp;and on&nbsp;LinkedIn.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

